    {
      "id": "5a8fe93e-a92c-4368-b32f-e569465ada60",
      "name": "Sticky Note 982ab4bb",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        912,
        384
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PF Darwin Tool: Session Follow-up\nManual path: the host tells Darwin \"I want to send the reward for my last session\".\n\nInput from Darwin: `user_id` (Slack), optional `session_number` (from the list) or `invitee_uri`.\n\nOpen sessions (last 30 days, started): `unanswered` goes to the did-they-join DM; `showed_up` and `reward_blocked` go straight to PF Reward. Rewarded, declined and no-show sessions are never offered. More than one: returns a numbered list for Darwin to show.\n\nTest without Darwin: edit **Test Input**, then run **Manual Test Run**.",
        "color": 5
      }
    }
